Name: haruki_tanaka
Description: Haruki Tanaka
Long_Description: Haruki Tanaka, CEO of Bushido-ArmaTech (BAT), is a charismatic and ambitious leader who preaches peace through strength. Beneath his composed exterior lies a deeply insecure individual driven by his father’s shadow and a desire to secure his legacy. Tanaka’s leadership has steered BAT into becoming a dominant force in military technology, blending innovation with ruthless pragmatism.
